Description:It is your first main phase. You control Strangleroot Geist (2/1 haste, undying) with no counters and have Fling in hand with two red mana floating (it empties when the phase ends). The opponent is at 5 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-undying-returns-hasty | Undying returns the creature as a new object with a +1/+1 counter (CR 702.93a, 400.7), and its printed haste lets it attack at once: Fling the Geist for 2, it returns as a 3/2 and attacks for 3; attacking first deals 2 and the floating mana is gone before Fling can follow (CR 106.4)
